    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The year is 3029...</h2><br>...you find yourself in a grand stadium crowded with spectators. The air is thick with anticipation as a cavalcade of lights dance across the colossal brass structures that encircle the arena. The engines roar to life, in union with the collective heartbeat of the crowd. The vehicles with a light hum pop up off the metallic floor, defying gravity. Welcome to The <strong>Neoathlon</strong>, where the legacy of human ingenuity becomes a galactic sport. Prepare to race through time, challenge the cosmos, and etch your name in the annals of racing history. Gear up, pilots, for the ride of a lifetime awaits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Neoathlon</h2><br>Neoathlon is a solo developed racing video game currently available for the PC as an early access title. Originally a student project I hope to make this project so much bigger than it could've been in just 10 weeks of work. Join me on the journey to produce a racing experience that is just as compelling to play as it is to spectate.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The year is 3029...</h2><br>...you find yourself in a grand stadium crowded with spectators. The air is thick with anticipation as a cavalcade of lights dance across the colossal brass structures that encircle the arena. The engines roar to life, in union with the collective heartbeat of the crowd. The vehicles with a light hum pop up off the metallic floor, defying gravity. Welcome to The <strong>Neoathlon</strong>, where the legacy of human ingenuity becomes a galactic sport. Prepare to race through time, challenge the cosmos, and etch your name in the annals of racing history. Gear up, pilots, for the ride of a lifetime awaits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Neoathlon</h2><br>Neoathlon is a solo developed racing video game currently available for the PC as an early access title. Originally a student project I hope to make this project so much bigger than it could've been in just 10 weeks of work. Join me on the journey to produce a racing experience that is just as compelling to play as it is to spectate.",
    "short_description": "A sci-fi racing title aimed at being a highly polished and fun experience for players and spectators alike. Neoathlon utilizes style and substance with its custom physics mechanics to make the most robust and enjoyable hover racing experience possible.",
